  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb<br>\n<strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0 (Weapon Mod)<br>\n<strong>Mods:</strong> All Ranged Weapons, individual eligibility by weapon category</p>\n<p>Changes the weapon's range table as listed (change the weapon's DV table field to match). The weapon can take attachments for its new category if it otherwise qualifies, and becomes Two-Handed and unconcealable. Damage, Autofire rating, Capacity, and Capacity Chart row don't change unless the kit says so. While installed, Range Table Modifications can't be added, removed, or swapped. SBR Kit (Assault and Sniper Rifles): Single Shot deals 1d6 less (minimum 4d6) and Autofire rating drops by 1 (minimum 3). Carbine becomes Snubnose Pistol, Assault Rifle becomes Subcompact SMG, Battle Rifle becomes SMG, Marksman or Scout Rifle becomes Long Barrel Pistol, Sniper or Anti-Materiel Rifle becomes Carbine.</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Mod Catalog &gt; Weapon Mods).</em></p>"
